	Section:
		Text: Barcodes
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: Error correction
		Paragraph: `Error correction` is the part of the modules of a QR code that can be damaged while it still reads: `low` 7%, `medium` 15% (the default), `quartile` 25% and `high` 30%. The same data needs more modules as the level rises, so at its natural size the code grows.
